    <string name="os_nacin_naslov">How should Safeer OS work?</string>
    <string name="os_nacin_opis">With Safeer Link your phone and computer join this TV: files from your computer, sending pages, the remote. Without it Safeer OS works on its own, with this TV only: the web, its files and USB, apps and the Shield. You can change this at any time.</string>
